    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "WATERSIDE PROPERTY :  Gallagher Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this exceptionally large two bedroom, two bathroom top floor Riverside Apartment with marina berth, the property incorporates some wonderful views of the River Shannon and the local countryside. Accommodation comprises of entrance hall, large open plan kitchen/diner/reception room (this space benefits from large windows/glass doors which opens out onto a large balcony overlooking the Waterfront Marina/local countryside and the Shannon/Erne waterway), bathroom, two large double bedrooms, the master bedroom benefits not only from an ensuite bathroom but also a private roof terrace. The property is located in the popular Waterfront Marina Development which is within walking distance of all village amenities. Leitrim Village offers an array of amenities such as shops, an excellent primary school, riverside bars and restaurants, Drumhierny Woodland Hideaway and Spa and the very popular Shannon Blueway which incorporates some wonderful walks. To appreciate all this top floor apartment has to offer please contact Gallagher Auctioneers to organise a viewing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall 5.26m (17'3\") x 3.97m (13'0\")\r\n\r\nOpen plan kitchen/diner/reception room 10.01m (32'10\") x 7.06m (23'2\")\r\n\r\nBathroom 3.09m (10'2\") x 2.55m (8'4\")\r\n\r\nBedroom One 3.72m (12'2\") x 3.63m (11'11\")\r\n\r\nBedroom Two 4.9m (16'1\") x 3.86m (12'8\")\r\n\r\nEnsuite 2.66m (8'9\") x 0.89m (2'11\")"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Riverside apartment with marina berth\r\n\r\nExceptionally large two bedroom top floor apartment \r\n\r\nWonderful views of the River Shannon\r\n\r\nBalcony & private roof terrace\r\n\r\nLocated within walking distance of all village amenities\r\n\r\nGas fired central heating"
      },
